# INVWINMW.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:COLDRAG.CFG (TEST/WIN/COLDRAG.CFG): drags with the driver's mouse
# lines.  The item list's Category divider dragged 30 pixels right widens
# the column to 22 characters, saved as WINCOLS.ITEM, which the split
# view's contents show too.  The tree's Name divider dragged 50 pixels
# left narrows it to 20, WINCOLS.TREE, the tree's automatic width
# following.  The splitter dragged 40 pixels right is saved as WINSPLIT.
# A drag held while F1's help window opens is cancelled, its release
# after ESC doing nothing, for a divider and the splitter; ESC
# during a drag of the tree's divider cancels it, the screen kept.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMW.SNP is its snapshot and
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/COLDRAG.CFG the settings it leaves; TEST/mousechk.py
# checks both.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
M 208 DOWN DIV 1
S DIVDN
M 208 MOVE DIV 1 30 0
M 208 UP DIV 1 30 0
S WIDER
M 208 DOWN DIV 1
M 208 MOVE DIV 1 30 0
K F1
S DIVF1
K ESC
M 208 UP DIV 1 30 0
S DIVF1UP
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 208 DOWN DIV 0
M 208 MOVE DIV 0 -50 0
M 208 UP DIV 0 -50 0
S TREENAR
M 208 DOWN DIV 0
M 208 MOVE DIV 0 -20 0
K ESC
S TREEESC
M 208 UP DIV 0 -20 0
S TREEUP
M 220 DOWN MID
S SPLITDN
M 220 MOVE MID 40 0
M 220 UP MID 40 0
S SPLITUP
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID 40 0
K F1
S SPLITF1
K ESC
M 220 UP MID 40 0
S SPLITF1U
K ALT-F X
